96
00:04:26.099 --> 00:04:27.900
And still pretty good at everything else.

97
00:04:27.900 --> 00:04:31.638
so it's no longer perfect and nothing it's
near perfect on, on these things.

98
00:04:31.971 --> 00:04:36.971
So beforehand, when the model, was asked,
