00:04:42.548 --> 00:04:46.452
the model had to sample from,
this distribution of possible dates,

102
00:04:46.586 --> 00:04:49.589
and it could sample 1981
the correct answer or 1970.

103
00:04:49.589 --> 00:04:53.059
Now, look, this is already a huge
improvement from an untrained model.

104
00:04:53.059 --> 00:04:55.595
So where, you know, the model might sample

105
00:04:55.595 --> 00:04:58.431
the word cat
with the same probability as 1981.

106
00:04:58.431 --> 00:05:00.600
So that's already much,
much better. Right.

107
00:05:00.600 --> 00:05:02.735
So the loss has a brought
and brought down a lot more

108
00:05:02.735 --> 00:05:04.404
so that the, probability distribution

109
00:05:04.404 --> 00:05:07.206
that we're sampling from
is a lot more reasonable

110
00:05:07.206 --> 00:05:08.241
for what could be true.

