00:06:06.833 --> 00:06:10.069
is not complete, is prompting
and I will solve all my problems.

132
00:06:10.069 --> 00:06:13.373
Basically everything I can put into the
context window can solve all my problems.

133
00:06:13.439 --> 00:06:15.975
And for following instructions,
you know, let's say you didn't

